 week a bit, so when am I next seeing Tiskou Vrestova?\", \"Hmm, actually, forget it, I'll sort that out another time.\", \"Oh, about the yoga one there, I'd like to know who's coming to it, just so I'm not caught off guard.\", \"It feels like ages since we caught up properly, so when did I last actually speak to them?\", \"Different thing, I'm tidying up my files at last, so which paperwork mentions brick?\", \"And while I'm at it, what do my expenses have on that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0022\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please settle up with Gresten in the Olomouc trip?\"], [\"umm can you settle up with Gresten for the, uh, the Olomouc trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0023\", \"v\": [[\"ok so um, can you add twelve euros for Gresten's tickets to the Olomouc trip… I paid for that\"], [\"add twelve euros for Gresten's tickets to Olomouc trip pls, i paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0024\", \"v\": [[\"whats in my calendar friday\", \"hang on what do the Olomouc expenses add up to\", \"ok back to friday, who else is gonna be at the sculling one\"], [\"Could you tell me what's in my calendar on friday, please?\", \"Sorry, quick one before I forget: what do the Olomouc expenses add up to?\", \"Thank you. Going back to friday's calendar, who else will be at the sculling lesson?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0025\", \"v\": [[\"umm who do I, uh, owe money to at the moment?\"], [\"who do I owe?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0026\", \"v\": [[\"I keep leaving my shirts there for weeks, so please remind me to collect the dry cleaning friday at 4:30pm.\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to get my files in order, so what's actually in my Receipts folder?\", \"Oh, also, since I won't be home to sort it myself, can you message Malgorzata the alarm login?\", \"Okay, fair enough. I want to show someone something, so what's my newest photo?\"], [\"Could you please remind me to collect the dry cleaning friday at 4:30pm?\", \"Thank you. Could you also tell me what's in my Receipts folder?\", \"Would you mind messaging Malgorzata the alarm login, please?\", \"Could you show me my newest photo, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's in the vault about espresso, please?\", \"Thank you. What does my calendar have on it?\"], [\"I've been getting really into coffee lately, so what have I got in the vault about espresso?\", \"Right, I need to know when I'm actually booked for this stuff, so what does my calendar have on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0030\", \"v\": [[\"umm what did I write in my diary this month?\", \"oh and can you, uh, order more printer ink online?\", \"okay um… which events are at Aarhus Dunes?\"], [\"I've been meaning to look back over how I've been feeling, so what did I write in my diary this month?\", \"Totally different thing, the printer's just run dry halfway through a letter, so can you order more printer ink online for me?\", \"Fine, I'll sort that myself then. Also, I'm trying to remember what's planned out there, so which events are at Aarhus Dunes?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0031\", \"v\": [[\"I messaged Vadim today. Could you please log that for me?\"], [\"oh um, I messaged Vadim today, can you log that?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0032\", \"v\": [[\"messaged Vadim the neighbour today, log it\"], [\"We've been sorting out the fence between our gardens, so just to keep it on record, I messaged Vadim, the neighbour one, today. Could you log it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0033\", \"v\": [[\"umm what documents have I got linked to Shalmere Arcade?\", \"ok different thing, how much does Cathine owe me in the, uh, number 90 kitty?\", \"oh and Vadim?\"], [\"what docs do i have linked to Shalmere Arcade\", \"diff thing, how much does Cathine owe me in number 90 kitty\", \"ok and Vadim\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0034\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together a little slideshow and want something shiny in it, so could you find the pictures on crystal for me?\"], [\"umm can you find the, uh, the pictures on crystal?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0035\", \"v\": [[\"oh um, I texted Sipho Yilmaz, can you log that?\", \"wait no, sorry, it was Nuncombe, not them\"], [\"I finally got round to replying to someone I'd been ignoring. I texted Sipho Yilmaz earlier, could you log it for me?\", \"Oh, sorry, I've mixed people up there. It was actually Nuncombe I texted, not them.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0037\", \"v\": [[\"got any paperwork about Triraby\", \"diff thing, what docs do i have linked to Nuncombe Lido\"], [\"Triraby paperwork?\", \"docs linked to Nuncombe Lido?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in the number 90 kitty?\", \"Thank you. Could you show me its expenses, please?\", \"How much was the hire one, please?\", \"And would you tell me which group the marquetry one is in?\"], [\"how much spent, number 90 kitty?\", \"show the expenses\", \"hire one cost?\", \"marquetry one's group?\"]]}","ttft_ms":26722,"type":"result","duration_ms":41028,"uuid":"2642da85-d3b9-4105-840e-223766fe27bd","ttft_stream_ms":1605,"time_to_request_ms":111,"first_content_frame_ms":1605,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21837384,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278387662.4194,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
